# Roshan: large neutral boss at the jungle pit. Appended last so unit indices hold. Health 6000 (npc_dota_roshan StatusHealth line 12151), damage 75 (AttackDamageMin/Max lines 12121-12122), armor 30 (ArmorPhysical line 12115), same source file as the tower above. UNVERIFIED: speed (source MovementSpeed 270, Dota units), radius, range and sight are placeholders (sim scale differs from Dota units).
unit("roshan", 6000, 800, 900, filters=["ground", "armored", "massive"], weapon_damage=75, weapon_range_milli=1500, weapon_period=24, sight_milli=6000, armor=30, model="character-skeleton", deny_pct=0)
# Bounty rune: a 1-hp pickup at a river point, no weapon. UNVERIFIED: health 1, radius 300 and model are placeholders.
unit("bounty_rune", 1, 0, 300, filters=["ground"], sight_milli=0, model="pillar-obelisk", deny_pct=0)
# Observer ward: StatusHealth 100, BountyGoldMin/Max 100, BountyXP 100, VisionDaytimeRange 1600 (npc_dota_observer_wards, same npc_units.txt at the same commit). Vision 1600 scales to 8000 milli at the hero ratio (sight 9000 for 1800): the scale is UNVERIFIED.
unit("observer_ward", 100, 0, 200, filters=["ground", "light"], sight_milli=8000, model="pillar-obelisk", deny_pct=0)
# Sentry ward: true sight 1050 (item_ward_sentry true_sight_range in items.txt), vision_range 0, health 100 is UNVERIFIED (copied from the observer). Detector 5250 milli is 1050 at the same x5 scale (UNVERIFIED scale).
unit("sentry_ward", 100, 0, 200, filters=["ground", "light"], sight_milli=0, model="pillar-obelisk", deny_pct=0)
# Courier: StatusHealth 6, BountyGold 35, MovementSpeed 290 (npc_dota_courier, npc_units.txt), VisionDaytimeRange 200. Speed 2700 milli keeps the hero ratio (hero 2800 for 300); sight 1000 is 200 at x5; both scales UNVERIFIED.
unit("courier", 6, 2700, 300, abilities=["courier_deliver"], filters=["ground", "light"], sight_milli=1000, model="character-skeleton", deny_pct=0)
